[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17166.47, "timestamp": "04:46:06", "text": "。我和一位資深YouTube主播，還有其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17174.39, "timestamp": "04:46:14", "text": "朋友，都去看了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17182.708, "timestamp": "04:46:22", "text": "首播，我們都為她/他們感到高興。隨著大量新觀眾的湧入，她的直播間也迅速走紅。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 17198.039, "timestamp": "04:46:38", "author": "@Shiori_mitsuki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dn0VbakjSKrSNaXx6PyhznuqbomoCGx22ivSawRcMXp25Io7cfsud3H3qP-g9QprPJUESlxxtJA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I lost all the motivation to stream im literally crying rn"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17203.23, "timestamp": "04:46:43", "text": "所以，那些一直支持她的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17207.27, "timestamp": "04:46:47", "text": "觀眾，出於對主播的忠誠，感覺有點奇怪，因為「哦，她要成為我的主播了，我的主播清單要變了，因為來了新觀眾等等」"}]